        "original_id": "11083eff-89ac-5e32-b4eb-5b5e183b5cf4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Microchip Technology, Keurig Green Mountain\n- Products: microcontrollers, semiconductors, coffeemakers\n- Topics: specialty coffee, analog semiconductors\n\nFacts:\n- Keurig Green Mountain was founded in 1981 and was formerly named Green Mountain Coffee Roasters.\n- Keurig Green Mountain is a specialty coffee and coffeemaker company headquartered in the United States.\n- Microchip Technology is an American manufacturer of microcontroller, memory, and analog semiconductors.\n- Microchip Technology products include microcontrollers such as PICmicro, dsPIC/PIC24, PIC32, AVR, AVR32, and SAM.\n- Microchip Technology products also include Serial EEPROM devices, Serial SRAM devices, KEELOQ devices, radio frequency devices, thermal devices, power and battery management analog devices, and linear, interface, and mixed signal devices.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
